<section id="about">
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-visual">
      <svg class="glyph" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none">
        <path d="M14 10 L14 54 L24 54 L24 26 L44 54 L54 54 L54 10 L44 10 L44 38 L24 10 Z" fill="url(#navGrad)"/>
      </svg>
      <h3>Built by people who ship.</h3>
      <p>Nexora is a small, hands-on technology studio — the same team that scopes your project is the team that writes the code, configures the server, and answers the phone after launch.</p>
      <div class="about-stats">
        <div><b>10</b><span>Service lines</span></div>
        <div><b>1 hr</b><span>Support SLA</span></div>
        <div><b>60d</b><span>Longest free support</span></div>
        <div><b>7</b><span>Tech stacks covered</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-body">
      <div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> About Nexora</div>
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,40px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.015em;margin-bottom:22px;">One studio, every layer of the stack.</h2>
      <p>Most businesses don't need ten different vendors — they need one team that understands how the website, the software, the network, and the cloud all fit together. That's the gap Nexora fills. <b>We build the front end you show customers, the systems you run internally, and the infrastructure that keeps it all online.</b></p>
      <p>Every engagement starts with a plain conversation about what you're trying to solve, not a sales script. From there we scope honestly, quote clearly, and stay reachable well past delivery — because a website that breaks silently a month later isn't actually finished.</p>

      <div class="value-list">
        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-num">01</div>
          <div><h4>Straight pricing</h4><p>Every plan lists what's included and what it starts at — no vague "contact for pricing" walls.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-num">02</div>
          <div><h4>Support that outlasts launch</h4><p>Free support windows on every plan, from 15 days on networking to 60 on custom software.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-num">03</div>
          <div><h4>Full-stack coverage</h4><p>Web, mobile, software, cloud, security, database, and automation — under one roof, one point of contact.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-num">04</div>
          <div><h4>Fast, direct communication</h4><p>Remote IT queries answered within the hour; project updates on WhatsApp or email, your choice.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

